{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s75bb686dcfcdfb54","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-49a212efa081295194e4","text":"やっほー！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f72ed954fd932251dc69","text":"すごい！夢の中でもメッセージを送れるんだ！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-d4b43113c57a2a0ae545","text":"もう着いた？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c26fcdae8b48ce1aa6be","text":"着いた","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-44be431c33c677da7c5a","text":"着いた{F#よ}{M#ぞ}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e9594b0bf13e21a75a79","text":"まだ着いてない","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3ed6c5a6350096efd829","text":"今向かってる{F#よ}{M#}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6e8596590f728336be97","text":"またウチのことだましたね！( ' ^ ' #)","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-fe68ead656a9b914e690","text":"さっき、姫子とヨウおじちゃんに連絡したんだけど、みんな違う夢境に行ってるみたいだね","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0060a288419757f27768","text":"ウチは今、黄昏の刻にいるよ！オークションを見学するつもり","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-8cebe63a979f343012fe","text":"合流するのは大変だから、まずは別行動するのはどう？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-251b8fc8b4d540d0ca8c","text":"アンタは黄金の刻にいるの？そこにある「夢境ショップ」はすごく有名なんだって！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-83b88c16b02b172dcb95","text":"ウチの代わりに行ってみて！もしいい感じだったら、ウチもあとで行くから！","speaker":""}]}
